WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
That's actually a helicopter

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The helicopter landed in Xiaoshui Village

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
See you for the first time in this life

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Whose big boss is this?

5
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Come to our village

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,780
He is a hundred times more beautiful than a star

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,780
How big a wealthy family this must be?

8
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:20,000
Mr. Zhang, I've been waiting for a long time.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Fully equipped

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:27,270
It's time for us to set off. Let's go. What's going on?

11
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,270
Guard your golden phoenix well

12
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:31,270
The woman next to me Zhang Tong

13
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:36,380
Your daughter is indeed incomparable to Zhang Tong

14
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,380
You really live in a shabby place like Xiaoshui Village

15
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,380
The house is too shabby, right?

16
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,380
The mountain is no longer high, there is a name first

17
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:44,380
It doesn’t matter if the house is broken down or not.

18
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,380
Just live comfortably

19
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,380
Tangbai Mountain is not a closed area.

20
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,380
Are you fully prepared?

21
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,380
Hatchet and short ball are more useful than hands

22
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:53,380
This time I went to the deep mountains and old forests.
